# Allowlist for the services/ml/Dockerfile build context (repo root): only the training
# package and the service. .env, data/ (licensed data, model weights), planning/, .git and
# local virtualenvs and caches never enter the image or the builder cache.
*
!ml/pyproject.toml
!ml/uv.lock
!ml/beacon_ml
!services/ml/pyproject.toml
!services/ml/uv.lock
!services/ml/app
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/*.egg-info
